{"id":"572865a260265c12","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction.md","title":"ACA0 Proves Arithmetical Induction","display":"thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction — ACA0 Proves Arithmetical Induction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction","aliases":["62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction"],"display":"thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction — ACA0 Proves Arithmetical Induction","depends_on":["[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-Induction]]","[[62-df-derivability]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.3; Lemma IX.1.1","source_pages":[7,360,361],"source_pdf_pages":[25,378,379]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ACA0-arithmetic-induction — ACA0 Proves Arithmetical Induction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" href=\"?note=0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" title=\"62-df-Induction\">62-df-Induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.3; Lemma IX.1.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>7</span><span>360</span><span>361</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span><span>378</span><span>379</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" href=\"?note=0f09dfa85ea5ca71\" title=\"62-df-Induction\">62-df-Induction</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{S_2}\">\\(\\vdash_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2))\\quad\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2))\\quad\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定算术公式 φ 的归纳前提，算术理解形成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\{n:\\varphi(n)\\}\">\\(X=\\{n:\\varphi(n)\\}\\)</span>；X 含 0 且对后继封闭，集合归纳推出全体 n 属于 X。公式参数随实例全称关闭。这里是逐个算术归纳实例的可推导性，未声称无条件的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 公式归纳。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.3; Lemma IX.1.1；纸面页 7, 360, 361；PDF 页 25, 378, 379。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Induction","status":"resolved","id":"0f09dfa85ea5ca71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-ACA0]]，$\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-ACA0]]，$\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{Ind}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-Induction]]，$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Induction","status":"resolved","id":"0f09dfa85ea5ca71","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"